      "version": "1.0.0",
      "createdAt": 1780814224502,
      "changelog": "xiaozhi-teach-chinese-reading-guide 1.0.0\n\n- Initial release for Chinese reading instruction, targeting language teachers.\n- Provides a modular framework: 文本三解 (literal/structure/theme), six reading strategies, and 三阶阅读 (basic/analysis/thinking).\n- Designed to help teachers move from ad-hoc reading guidance to a systematized teaching approach.\n- Includes workflow integration with lesson planner, student analyzer, and classroom coach.\n- Supports key scenarios such as lesson planning, reading difficulties, strategy teaching, thematic multi-text reading, and reading comprehension assessment.\n- Emphasizes visible thinking, explicit teaching of reading strategies, and documentation of student reading progress.",
